<section class="ziyu-hero">
  <div class="ziyu-container ziyu-grid-12">
    <div class="ziyu-hero__copy">
      <span class="ziyu-label">Intentional Technology</span>

      <h1 class="ziyu-display">
        Technology designed to help people live intentionally.
      </h1>

      <p class="ziyu-body-lg">
        We create digital tools that prioritize your presence over your attention. Ziyu Development is a craft studio dedicated to apps, archives, and systems that foster real-life focus and personal growth.
      </p>

      <div class="ziyu-hero__actions">
        <a href="/pages/support" class="ziyu-button">Support the Future</a>
        <a href="/pages/goal-grower" class="ziyu-button ziyu-button--ghost">Explore Goal Grower</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ziyu-hero__visual">
      <div class="ziyu-hero__orb-one"></div>
      <div class="ziyu-hero__orb-two"></div>

      <div class="ziyu-hero__collage">
        <div class="ziyu-card ziyu-hero__image-main">
          <img class="ziyu-image ziyu-grayscale" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366754035-f200968a6e72?q=80&w=1400&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Intentional workspace" width="1400" height="1000">
        </div>

        <div class="ziyu-card ziyu-hero__image-small">
          <img class="ziyu-image" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1455390582262-044cdead277a?q=80&w=800&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Journal notes" width="800" height="1100">
        </div>

        <div class="ziyu-hero__note">
          <span class="ziyu-label ziyu-label--muted">Studio Note</span>
          <p class="ziyu-h3" style="font-style: italic;">
            “Not faster. Not louder. Just more human.”
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section ziyu-section--soft">
  <div class="ziyu-container ziyu-grid-12">
    <div style="grid-column: span 5;">
      <span class="ziyu-label">The Problem</span>
      <h2 class="ziyu-h2">We are surrounded by tools designed to fragment attention.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="ziyu-text-stack" style="grid-column: span 7;">
      <p class="ziyu-body-lg">Most digital products are optimized for retention, stimulation, and endless return. They shape how we think, what we notice, and how easily we can be still.</p>
      <p class="ziyu-body-lg">Ziyu is built from a different assumption: technology should help people become more present, not more scattered.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section ziyu-section--dark">
  <div class="ziyu-manifesto">
    <span class="ziyu-label" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);">Manifesto</span>
    <h2 class="ziyu-display" style="font-size: clamp(52px, 7vw, 88px);">
      Most technology is designed to capture attention. We are trying to build tools that return it.
    </h2>
    <p style="margin-top: 32px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78); font-size: 18px;">
      Not faster. Not louder. Not more addictive. Just more human.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section">
  <div class="ziyu-container">
    <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 90px;">
      <span class="ziyu-label">The Vision</span>
      <h2 class="ziyu-h2">A quieter digital future.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="ziyu-grid-3">
      <div class="ziyu-card" style="padding: 40px;">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 48px; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 32px;">visibility</span>
        <h3 class="ziyu-h4">Clarity</h3>
        <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 16px;">Interfaces that remove noise and help users see what matters.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-card" style="padding: 40px;">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 48px; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 32px;">spa</span>
        <h3 class="ziyu-h4">Intentionality</h3>
        <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 16px;">Systems built around deliberate action instead of unconscious scrolling.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-card" style="padding: 40px;">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-size: 48px; color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 32px;">potted_plant</span>
        <h3 class="ziyu-h4">Human Flourishing</h3>
        <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 16px;">Tools that support growth, reflection, learning, and real-life presence.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ziyu-section ziyu-section--soft">
  <div class="ziyu-container">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 48px; margin-bottom: 90px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
      <div>
        <span class="ziyu-label">Featured Projects</span>
        <h2 class="ziyu-h2">Artifacts in progress.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="ziyu-body-lg" style="max-width: 420px;">Each project is treated like a chapter in the larger archive: part product, part experiment, part philosophy.</p>
    </div>

    <a href="/pages/goal-grower" class="ziyu-project">
      <div class="ziyu-project__copy">
        <span class="ziyu-label ziyu-label--muted">Chapter 01 · In Development</span>
        <h3 class="ziyu-h2">Goal Grower</h3>
        <p class="ziyu-body-lg" style="margin-top: 24px;">Growth visualized through intentional systems. A botanical goal tracker for long-term consistency.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 28px; color: var(--primary);">View Chapter →</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-card ziyu-project__visual">
        <img class="ziyu-image" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1466692476868-aef1dfb1e735?q=80&w=1800&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Goal Grower" width="1800" height="1100">
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="/pages/blokkr" class="ziyu-project ziyu-project--reverse">
      <div class="ziyu-project__copy">
        <span class="ziyu-label ziyu-label--muted">Chapter 02 · Hardware Experiment</span>
        <h3 class="ziyu-h2">Blokkr</h3>
        <p class="ziyu-body-lg" style="margin-top: 24px;">A physical ritual for entering deep work and creating a boundary between attention and distraction.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 28px; color: var(--primary);">View Chapter →</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ziyu-card ziyu-project__visual">
        <img class="ziyu-image ziyu-grayscale" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366754035-f200968a6e72?q=80&w=1800&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Blokkr" width="1800" height="1100">
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

